flvmeta
------------------------------------------
flvmeta is a command-line utility aimed at manipulating Adobe(tm) Flash Video
files (FLV).

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libyaml0_2-0.2.5-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libyaml-devel-0.2.5-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/noirotm/flvmeta

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/noirotm/flvmeta/archive/refs/tags/v1.3.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack flvmeta-1.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./flvmeta-1.3.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/flvmeta-1.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/flvmeta-1.3.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(flvmeta)
  /usr/bin/flvmeta.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/flvmeta.README
  /usr/share/doc/flvmeta/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/flvmeta/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/doc/flvmeta/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/flvmeta/TODO

